Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:09:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] lattice: add sol_mldsa65_verify syscall

sol_mldsa65_verify(version, pk_addr, msg_addr, msg_len, sig_addr) -> u64
verifies an ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204) signature inside the SBF runtime.
Charges agave_mldsa_verify::verify_cost(min(msg_len, 4096)) CU before
reading input, rejects unsupported versions and messages > 4096 bytes,
and returns 0 or an MlDsaVerifyError code. Feature gated by
enable_mldsa65_verify_syscall.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
